# --- (g) section symbol + addend and a same-address OBJECT alias: the ISR side
# --- writes `.mcs251.OSEG.1 + 2` and the foreground side `.mcs251.OSEG.3 + 2`,
# --- so the conflicting pair is the `_PARM_3` slots at offset 2 with shared
# --- range [0x0002,0x0004); the untouched `_PARM_2` slots and the OBJECT alias
# --- must not appear.
