# --- (m) ISR vs ISR: two registered ISRs' overlaid slots.  Without a declared
# --- preemption pair the overlap is conditional; with the pair declared it is
# --- proven.  The external preemption contract is validated independently of
# --- severity and of whether facts were requested.
