# --- (n) the structured result is authoritative and complete: a group with
# --- three ISR-side slots and one foreground slot must publish ALL four
# --- participating slots, their per-slot access evidence, and the specific
# --- proving pair - in the facts interface.
# RUN: yaml2obj %t-seed/multis.yaml -o %t.m.o
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/isr-v2flags.py %t.m.o
# RUN: mcs251-lld %t.crt.o %t.m.o --area-start=HOME=0xff0000 \
