# SAMESTR-ISR-COND: warning: ISR reentrancy: conditional slot overlap: one parameter slot is reached from interleavable contexts
# SAMESTR-ISR-COND: missing condition(s) for a proven violation: ISR-vs-ISR preemption is not declared
# RUN: not mcs251-lld %t.crt.o %t.ts.o --area-start=HOME=0xff0000 \
# RUN:   --area-start=BOOT=0xff0500 --area-start=CSEG=0xff0700 \
# RUN:   --area-start=XINIT=0xff8000 --isr-preemption-config=%t-seed/preempt-2.txt \
