# SAMESTR-ISR-PROVEN: error: ISR reentrancy: proven static parameter-slot contract violation: one parameter slot is reached from interleavable contexts
# SAMESTR-ISR-PROVEN: error: ISR reentrancy:     by '_irq1' ({{.*}}, ISR context; writes slot before the call
# SAMESTR-ISR-PROVEN: error: ISR reentrancy:     by '_irq2' ({{.*}}, ISR context; writes slot before the call
# SAMESTR-ISR-PROVEN: interleaving condition: declared preemption between the two ISR roots (external preemption contract)

