# --- three ISR-side slots on one address and only `_irq2/_irq3` declared,
# --- the group proves via (_s2,_s3): that exact pair is the serialized
# --- `slots=`, carries the A/B root evidence, and the other pairs are listed
# --- with their own missing declaration.  Four ISR slots declared for
# --- `_irq3/_irq4` behave the same.
