# --- (z3) ROUND-4: CRT contract closedness.  A `9A` inside an OPERAND
# --- (`75 00 9A`, the immediate of a classic MOV direct,#imm) behind which
# --- the `_main` chain relocation was moved, and a FOURTH raw `9A` with no
# --- relocation, are both OUTSIDE the constrained profile: no contract
# --- records, no contract-evidence boot chain, and the shared-slot case
# --- stays conditional.  The intact CRT in the same shape stays proven.
