# --- (z6) ROUND-5 finding 1: the CRT profile is closed on the chain
# --- targets' LANDING POINTS, not only on their names.  A CRT whose
# --- `__mcs251_globals_init` (or `__mcs251_xdata_init`) keeps its NAME,
# --- its section, all 12 anchors and all 0x106 template bytes but moves
# --- its symbol VALUE (onto the `80 FE` halt self-loop at 0x48) is NOT the
# --- supported profile: no kind=1 records, no contract-evidence chain, and
# --- the shared-slot case stays conditional.  The intact CRT in the same
# --- shape stays proven (positive baseline).
