# --- (z8) ROUND-5 finding 3: the preemption contract FILE is an input.
# --- No published artifact -- final or staging -- may resolve to the same
# --- file (same path, symlink or hard link) in ANY output mode; before the
# --- fix the facts publication silently replaced the contract text with
# --- `MCS251-LINK-FACTS 1' while all three modes still returned 0.  The
# --- success control uses a contract of two DISTINCT ISR names.
