# --- (z9) ROUND-5 finding 4: a preemption pair that names the SAME ISR
# --- entry twice is REJECTED explicitly in every severity mode and with
# --- facts requested -- never silently accepted and then dropped by the
# --- (distinct-root) analysis.  No conclusion about hardware self-preemption
# --- is drawn either way.
