# `.mcs251.OSEG.1 + 2` and the foreground side `.mcs251.OSEG.3 + 2`, so the
# conflict is the _PARM_3 pair.  z_isr_alias aliases _isr_scale_PARM_3.
#
# .text layout: _irq1@0 size 0xB, _isr_scale@0xB size 7, _main@0x12 size 0xB,
# _fg_scale@0x1D size 7 (same instruction shapes as conflict.yaml; only the
# relocated addends and slot sizes differ).
